    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank seven Immortal Gu, a rank higher than Fang Yuan’s Spring Autumn Cicada. After nurturing finishes, it is grey, the size of a little finger, and shaped like a silkworm cocoon.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-path-and-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The text also names it a genuine self sacrifice Gu used to abandon oneself for others.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-path-and-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Narration calls it a luck path Gu refined by interaction with Divert Disaster Gu of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building.",
        "chapters": [
          568
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-path-and-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_luck",
          "gu_divert_disaster_immortal_gu",
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It and Divert Disaster Gu are two sides of the same coin: one attracts calamities while the other diverts disaster.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-path-and-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The early stage Immortal Gu is like a thumb-sized cocoon. While it flies, the strong light is like a cocoon.",
        "chapters": [
          566
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the cocoon bursts, it is fully formed. It is completely grey, the size of a little finger, shaped like a silkworm cocoon, and looks very delicate.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
