  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside ownerless Water Pavilion, Fang Yuan finds an early stage Immortal Gu in a large red bowl and reads inkman text that names it Calamity beckoning Gu after he opens Mo Yao’s Di Qiu inheritance. The inheritance that fostered it was created by Mo Yao, thirty-sixth generation fairy of Spirit Affinity House.",
        "chapters": [
          566
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_water_pavilion",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_mo_yao",
          "inh_di_qiu_inheritance",
          "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Mo Yao refined it to help Sword Immortal Bo Qing endure the tribulations of a rank nine breakthrough by drawing those calamities onto herself.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "mo-yao-and-bo-qing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bo_qing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Spirit Affinity House records later restate that she refined it from luck path essence in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building for Bo Qing, that the copy drew away part of Bo Qing’s tribulation, that both still died, and that the copy was destroyed.",
        "chapters": [
          749
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "mo-yao-and-bo-qing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan lends calamity beckoning Immortal Gu to Chu Du while taking flying sword Immortal Gu and an eagle nest in return. With Chu Du’s help, this third calamity is far less dangerous for Fang Yuan than his first two, in which he was gravely injured.",
        "chapters": [
          1114
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "third-earthly-calamity",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chu_du"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the northern icy plain Chu Du activates the rank seven Gu so Fang Yuan’s sovereign blessed land entrance opens and spring dawn jade orioles and giant disaster blazing trees are forced out until the third earthly calamity ends.",
        "chapters": [
          1113
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "third-earthly-calamity",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
